      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Liquidity",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "Interest rates on advances of our Credit Facility are determined by a pricing matrix based on our long-term debt ratings assigned by Standard & Poor's Ratings Services (S&P) and Moody's Investors Service (Moody’s).",
